    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... people say that, but it feels like they're just saying it to make themselves feel better. like they're trying to pull me back to a shore i don't even want to be on. what if there's nothing left to find? what if the drift is just the natural state of things for me?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
