      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those thoughts of stopping and fading are unfortunately a common and dangerous part of the pain of depression, not necessarily a solved option. Your worth is not measured by your ability to swim against the current, and even when things feel permanently broken, professional help exists specifically to share that weight for you. Please reach out to a crisis line immediately; they are there to listen and help you find a way forward without judgment, because you deserve support through this storm.",
